styk-auto/1
# The Properties panel on tests/edit/startup.document.json (figure 1 selected): a drag of a scrub label, a typed value,
# an arrow step on a label, undo and redo, each checked by what the panel then shows and what history holds.
select 1
inspector scrub root_x 20
expect history 1
inspector type root_y 300
expect property root_y 300
expect history 2
inspector step scale up
expect property scale 101
expect history 3
click undo
click undo
click undo
expect property root_x 480
expect property root_y 280
expect property scale 100
expect history 0
click redo
expect history 1
